        "source_url": "https://docs.snowflake.com/en/user-guide/snowflake-cortex/pricing.md",
        "body": "<h2>Snowflake AI pricing</h2>\n<h2>AI Credit price</h2>\n<table>\n<tr><td>Routing type</td><td>Price per AI Credit</td><td>When it applies</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Global routing</td><td>$2.00</td><td>`CORTEX_ENABLED_CROSS_REGION` is set to `ANY_REGION`, `AWS_GLOBAL`, `GCP_GLOBAL`, or `AZURE_GLOBAL`. Requests can be routed across broader Snowflake-supported capacity, providing the lowest AI Credit price and broader model availability.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Regional routing</td><td>$2.20</td><td>`CORTEX_ENABLED_CROSS_REGION` is set to `DISABLED` or a specific regional setting such as `AWS_US`, `AWS_EU`, `AZURE_US`, or `AZURE_EU`. Requests are restricted to the account&#x27;s home region or selected geographies, typically for data residency or compliance requirements.</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h2>Snowflake AI pricing</h2>\n<h2>Features that use AI Credit pricing</h2>\n<table>\n<tr><td>Feature</td><td>Pricing type</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Cortex Code</td><td>AI Credit</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Cortex Agents</td><td>AI Credit</td></tr>\n</table>"
      }
